<#ff96dc>SUGAR METER</>
Eat a Candy		^X
  Landing hits fills the 3 candies (blocked hits a little).
  Takes a moment and can be punished: hit while eating
  and the candy is lost.
Sugar Rush (6 sec, eat again for more)
  Faster walk and dash. Any normal into any other normal
  (each one once per combo). Normals jump cancel on hit.
  Cutting Air hits twice.
Sugar Crash (after the rush)
  Dazed and open for a moment, then slower and 10% less
  damage for 1.5 seconds.
Sweet Healing (3 candies)		_D^X
  Eats the whole bag: life back.

<#ff96dc>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab (air too)		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.

<#ff96dc>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A ^B ^C
Standing Light Kick		_F^A
Crouching Light Kick		_DF^A
Air Light Kick (in the air)		_F^A

<#ff96dc>SPECIALS</>
Cutting Air (air: Stripe Strike)		_D_DF_F^A/^B
Cutting Barrage (500 meter)		_D_DF_F^C
Thigh Highs Cutter		_F_D_DF^A/^B
  B version: the slam ground bounces them, then chase in
  the air.
Stripecopter		_D_DB_B^A/^B
Surprising Stripes		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A/^B
Tight Blender		_D_D^A/^B

<#ff96dc>SUPERS</>
Backstabbing Air (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Stripping Blender (2 bars)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Hyper Cutting Barrage (2)		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^A_+^B
Critical Slash (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
FLY AWAY NOW (3, low life)		_D_DF_F_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work for the two-button supers.
